<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia's Droga says H1 net profit up 9 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia's Droga says H1 net profit up 9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian food producer Droga Portoroz said on Monday net profit in the first half of the year rose nine percent to 314.9 million tolars ($2.3 million).</p>
<p>Sales were up 19 percent at 5.1 billion tolars ($36.9 million), the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;Revenues increased mostly because of higher exports, especially to other former Yugoslav republics,&quot; deputy chief executive Ivan Majcen told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
